WEBVTT

01:31.988 --> 01:37.306
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.306 --> 01:40.365
[Episode 18]

02:25.520 --> 02:26.759
Shopkeeper Mudan.

02:26.759 --> 02:28.168
Mr. Wu.

02:31.879 --> 02:33.352
Shopkeeper Mudan.

02:35.759 --> 02:37.360
Suizhi

02:37.360 --> 02:38.400
came last night,

02:39.439 --> 02:40.599
and he has been sitting there all along

02:41.759 --> 02:43.159
without saying a word.

02:45.439 --> 02:46.800
Many years ago,

02:48.680 --> 02:50.400
I saw him

02:51.000 --> 02:52.319
being like this.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.840
It was also because of Mrs. Bai and his son.

02:59.680 --> 03:01.560
Mr. Wu.

03:01.560 --> 03:03.240
When Mrs. Bai was giving birth,

03:03.800 --> 03:04.800
he was there.

03:05.800 --> 03:07.039
What exactly happened?

03:13.560 --> 03:15.639
If Suizhi told you about that,

03:15.639 --> 03:18.080
he must have considered you

03:18.080 --> 03:19.759
as a close friend to confide in.

03:22.919 --> 03:25.080
The day when the son of the Bai Family was born

03:26.159 --> 03:27.879
was also the time

03:29.319 --> 03:30.960
when Suizhi's mother died.

03:48.039 --> 03:49.360
Suizhi.

03:50.919 --> 03:52.264
I'm here.

03:55.800 --> 03:57.680
Your father…

03:59.159 --> 04:00.520
Where is he?

04:15.268 --> 04:18.184
[Why fear death if one can be conjugal, wishing
to be a couple rather than immortals]

04:19.560 --> 04:20.959
Yuantang.

04:27.360 --> 04:28.439
Suizhi.

04:31.519 --> 04:32.560
I want…

04:33.759 --> 04:35.120
to see your father,

04:36.040 --> 04:37.519
one

04:39.360 --> 04:40.600
last time.

04:50.839 --> 04:52.200
Mother.

04:53.000 --> 04:54.408
Wait.

04:55.480 --> 04:57.120
I will bring him back.

05:11.752 --> 05:12.879
Let's go.

05:12.879 --> 05:15.759
Master. Master.

05:17.399 --> 05:18.480
The Lady is experiencing a difficult labor.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.920
There is a risk of hemorrhage.

05:25.040 --> 05:26.839
My mother is dying.

05:36.079 --> 05:37.680
She is fighting for me,

05:38.560 --> 05:39.959
with her life hanging by a thread.

05:41.079 --> 05:43.040
I cannot leave her.

05:44.720 --> 05:45.879
Go back first.

05:45.879 --> 05:47.199
Let your mother wait.

05:47.199 --> 05:48.360
When everything settles down here,

05:48.360 --> 05:49.879
I will rush back immediately.

05:49.879 --> 05:51.759
But Mother has been waiting
for you for so long.

05:55.879 --> 05:58.079
She is your lawful wife.

06:01.360 --> 06:03.600
You have also solemnly written

06:04.199 --> 06:05.959
the promise of never failing her in this life.

06:10.480 --> 06:11.720
Why do you

06:13.079 --> 06:14.839
treat her this way now?

06:19.240 --> 06:21.639
She just wants to see you one last time.

06:30.519 --> 06:31.680
I won't be able to repay

06:32.360 --> 06:33.920
what I owe her in this lifetime.

06:34.600 --> 06:35.976
In the next life,

06:37.279 --> 06:38.680
I will certainly not let her down.

07:02.759 --> 07:05.279
Vows of love

07:05.279 --> 07:06.839
and talks of being together until death

07:09.360 --> 07:11.560
cause others pain if you're heartless,

07:12.680 --> 07:14.480
and harm yourself when you're madly in love.

08:17.319 --> 08:18.839
Her child didn't deserve to die,

08:20.639 --> 08:22.360
but what about my mother?

08:25.040 --> 08:26.279
So that's what he meant

08:28.680 --> 08:29.879
by saying that.

08:31.920 --> 08:33.159
After Madam

08:33.159 --> 08:34.320
passed away,

08:35.840 --> 08:38.000
Suizhi became dispirited

08:38.000 --> 08:39.200
and knelt in front of the bed

08:41.039 --> 08:42.720
all night long.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.240
He never left

08:46.120 --> 08:47.440
until he fainted.

08:49.039 --> 08:50.399
After waking up,

08:51.919 --> 08:53.639
he became this way,

08:55.120 --> 08:56.200
refusing to talk

08:57.080 --> 08:58.480
or eat.

09:00.600 --> 09:01.919
No wonder he swore

09:01.919 --> 09:03.000
to never marry.

09:04.320 --> 09:05.799
It must have been at that time

09:06.799 --> 09:08.799
that he no longer believed in earthly love.

09:09.879 --> 09:12.559
Instead, he lived as a heartless person.

09:15.879 --> 09:17.352
He, you see,

09:17.960 --> 09:19.399
appears to be

09:19.399 --> 09:20.840
a heartless person,

09:21.799 --> 09:25.200
when in fact, he sets out to repay

09:25.200 --> 09:26.600
even the smallest favor.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.360
A few years ago,

09:29.360 --> 09:31.159
my relatives in my hometown Luoyang

09:31.720 --> 09:34.240
all died from the epidemic.

09:35.279 --> 09:36.919
I was utterly disheartened

09:38.000 --> 09:39.120
and I thought

09:39.960 --> 09:41.279
of ending my life.

09:43.080 --> 09:46.399
Suizhi was the one who saved me.

09:48.320 --> 09:50.279
I was just a steward

09:50.279 --> 09:52.080
in the compound of his mother's.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.799
A servant, that's all.

09:55.759 --> 09:59.360
Yet he personally came
to Luoyang to take me back.

10:00.159 --> 10:01.240
He told me

10:03.159 --> 10:04.519
these children

10:05.799 --> 10:07.240
are my family.

10:08.759 --> 10:10.320
This is what gave me

10:10.320 --> 10:11.799
a reason to live.

10:13.240 --> 10:14.960
His usual grins and banter

10:14.960 --> 10:16.120
are all just a facade.

10:16.960 --> 10:19.480
He harbors pain in his heart.

10:23.879 --> 10:24.960
Mudan,

10:24.960 --> 10:26.799
even if you don't like Suizhi,

10:27.320 --> 10:29.799
could you, when he is lonely and in sorrow,

10:29.799 --> 10:30.919
spend more time with him?

10:31.720 --> 10:33.120
Over the years,

10:33.120 --> 10:34.679
he has been truly too lonely.

10:40.759 --> 10:42.159
He must be having a struggle

10:42.919 --> 10:44.519
of conscience and desire inside.

10:46.919 --> 10:48.440
He clearly knows everything.

10:49.320 --> 10:51.759
All this was his father's fault,

10:53.120 --> 10:54.120
but,

10:54.120 --> 10:55.879
if he saves that mother and child,

10:56.759 --> 10:58.519
he would feel

10:58.519 --> 10:59.559
like he has betrayed

10:59.559 --> 11:00.679
his own mother.

11:01.799 --> 11:03.039
But if he doesn't save them,

11:08.559 --> 11:10.519
how could he live with himself?

11:12.120 --> 11:13.399
This is

11:14.919 --> 11:16.200
his dilemma.

11:51.080 --> 11:52.679
You've been at it for so long.

11:52.679 --> 11:54.000
Have some flower cakes

12:03.120 --> 12:04.616
and some tea.

12:05.600 --> 12:06.728
I'm not thirsty.

12:12.039 --> 12:14.320
I'm here to congratulate you, Mr. Jiang.

12:15.519 --> 12:17.360
Your enemy is about to die.

12:18.080 --> 12:20.080
So you needn't be troubled anymore

12:20.080 --> 12:21.679
and you can return home early.

12:24.000 --> 12:26.559
This mother and son of the Bai family
were easy to deceive.

12:27.639 --> 12:29.679
I deceived them into thinking we were at odds

12:29.679 --> 12:31.279
and lured them into the trap

12:31.279 --> 12:33.200
by inviting the doctor
to come for a consultation.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.240
And Mrs. Bai

12:35.240 --> 12:36.720
thought she met a bodhisattva.

12:37.840 --> 12:39.080
Little did she know that the child's illness

12:39.080 --> 12:40.159
was extremely tricky.

12:40.840 --> 12:43.039
Only Master Doctor Fu could treat him.

12:43.799 --> 12:46.240
Anyone else would be
powerless to make a difference.

12:48.440 --> 12:49.679
Where are they now?

12:51.200 --> 12:52.360
You don't have to worry about that.

12:52.960 --> 12:54.559
They have been sent to the inn.

12:55.679 --> 12:56.720
Within three days,

12:57.720 --> 12:58.759
they will certainly die.

13:10.159 --> 13:11.679
Thank you for helping me
drag them to their deaths.

13:12.639 --> 13:14.039
I will prepare the coffin money,

13:14.600 --> 13:15.840
waiting for the boy to take his last breath.

13:19.440 --> 13:20.559
Thank you for making this trip.

13:22.279 --> 13:23.560
This is for you.

13:24.600 --> 13:26.240
What is this?

13:26.240 --> 13:27.919
It's a gold bar.

13:27.919 --> 13:29.224
Can't you tell?

13:53.960 --> 13:55.496
Young lady.

13:59.679 --> 14:01.200
You are…

14:01.200 --> 14:02.759
My name is Fu.

14:02.759 --> 14:04.960
Last night, Mr. Jiang said he had
avenged a great enmity

14:04.960 --> 14:07.080
and gotten overly joyful for a moment.

14:07.080 --> 14:08.679
He drank and caught the wind,

14:08.679 --> 14:10.279
resulting in a cough,

14:10.279 --> 14:11.720
and asked me to take a look at him.

14:11.720 --> 14:13.759
You took the wrong way.
The Jiang Mansion is over there.

14:14.360 --> 14:16.000
Zhaocai, what were you…

14:16.000 --> 14:17.320
After seeing Mr. Jiang,

14:17.320 --> 14:19.600
he instructed that there was
a lady in the backyard

14:19.600 --> 14:21.200
whose tendons in her right hand were damaged.

14:21.200 --> 14:23.600
Since I'm here, let me also have a look.

14:25.519 --> 14:27.519
I have already properly treated her hand.

14:27.519 --> 14:28.799
There's no need for others to…

14:37.679 --> 14:39.279
You are Master Doctor Fu
from the Imperial Medical Bureau.

14:40.399 --> 14:42.879
I have memorized
all the medical books you wrote.

14:42.879 --> 14:43.960
I never thought I could

14:43.960 --> 14:45.240
meet you in person one day.

14:46.559 --> 14:47.799
There is a child at this moment

14:47.799 --> 14:49.679
who has one of the difficult and miscellaneous
diseases mentioned in your book

14:49.679 --> 14:50.759
and urgently needs you to take a look.

14:59.159 --> 15:01.440
This illness of Jiang Changyang came
at quite an opportune time.

15:11.000 --> 15:12.000
[Restaurant]
Come, lift your foot.

15:14.519 --> 15:16.008
Go inside.

15:18.000 --> 15:19.320
Wait inside for me.

15:24.399 --> 15:25.600
Madam.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.279
This money and silk are for the child.

15:29.879 --> 15:31.840
Thank you, young lady, for saving my son.

15:31.840 --> 15:34.639
My son and I have no way to repay
your great kindness.

15:34.639 --> 15:35.720
You're welcome.

15:35.720 --> 15:37.000
Keep it.

15:37.000 --> 15:38.159
Come on, accept it.

15:40.480 --> 15:42.720
Young lady, you have such a kind heart.

15:43.480 --> 15:45.559
You are a shopkeeper

15:45.559 --> 15:46.919
working for Jiang Changyang,

15:46.919 --> 15:49.519
but you saved Fan'er behind his back.

15:49.519 --> 15:51.159
Young lady, be extremely careful.

15:51.159 --> 15:53.240
I'm afraid if he finds out,
you will be punished.

15:55.200 --> 15:58.440
Madam, the person who truly
deserves your gratitude is not me.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.440
If he really wants your son

16:00.440 --> 16:02.080
to be tormented by this illness
for his entire life.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.039
In this vast city of Chang'an,

16:04.039 --> 16:05.240
who can

16:05.240 --> 16:06.840
really save Fan'er?

16:17.080 --> 16:18.840
Chuanyu.

16:18.840 --> 16:20.720
Master Doctor Fu's
consultation fee is not cheap.

16:20.720 --> 16:22.039
My Lord said

16:22.039 --> 16:23.879
if he let a miserly person like Lady He

16:24.519 --> 16:26.120
make such an advance,

16:26.120 --> 16:27.240
it will be recovered from elsewhere

16:27.240 --> 16:28.480
in double or more,

16:28.480 --> 16:29.480
so he asked me to give you the money.

16:30.720 --> 16:32.279
Alright, if that's the case,

16:33.279 --> 16:34.279
I will take it.

16:40.679 --> 16:42.159
Is there anything else?

16:42.720 --> 16:43.759
He didn't say anything else.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.759
But I…

16:50.000 --> 16:51.120
Lady He,

16:51.120 --> 16:52.519
over the years, only you were able

16:52.519 --> 16:53.679
to see through his act.

16:54.279 --> 16:55.759
Since you understand his thoughts so well,

16:55.759 --> 16:57.080
why not persuade him further

16:57.080 --> 16:58.440
to no longer torment himself anymore?

16:58.440 --> 16:59.440
Letting go of the hatred

16:59.440 --> 17:01.000
will make him truly happy, won't it?

17:03.919 --> 17:05.319
He chose to save others

17:05.319 --> 17:06.359
because he has

17:06.359 --> 17:07.400
a soft heart.

17:08.039 --> 17:10.319
Only a Bodhisattva can forgive everything.

17:10.319 --> 17:12.240
But being a Bodhisattva is boring.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.319
One can neither eat meat

17:13.319 --> 17:14.839
nor drink wine.

17:14.839 --> 17:16.720
If it were me,

17:16.720 --> 17:18.279
I would make

17:18.279 --> 17:19.519
the same choice as him.

17:22.279 --> 17:23.799
Therefore,

17:23.799 --> 17:25.599
there's no need to let go of the hatred.

17:25.599 --> 17:27.400
Just let oneself be.

17:27.400 --> 17:28.599
Being a layperson

17:28.599 --> 17:29.640
is not a bad thing.

17:30.160 --> 17:31.592
I'm leaving.

17:42.400 --> 17:43.720
You think you understand me?

17:44.240 --> 17:46.039
I am the number one
corrupt official in Chang'an.

17:46.839 --> 17:48.279
A soft heart?

17:49.640 --> 17:50.960
You are the soft one.

18:00.240 --> 18:02.720
I threw the money right in Mrs. Bai's face

18:03.440 --> 18:04.920
and told her,

18:04.920 --> 18:06.680
listen,

18:06.680 --> 18:08.640
this is the coffin money from Mr. Jiang.

18:09.480 --> 18:11.200
Whether he lives or dies in the future

18:11.200 --> 18:13.480
has nothing to do with Mr. Jiang.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.880
If you dare to appear again

18:14.880 --> 18:16.279
before Mr. Jiang,

18:16.279 --> 18:18.559
don't blame Mr. Jiang for being ruthless

18:18.559 --> 18:20.079
and burying you on the spot.

18:20.079 --> 18:21.704
Do you understand?

18:27.680 --> 18:29.160
Sorry.

18:30.079 --> 18:31.839
What you're saying

18:31.839 --> 18:33.920
sounds different from what Chuanyu said.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.119
Outside the inn,

18:36.119 --> 18:38.519
he saw with his own eyes
that you politely sent the guests away.

18:40.119 --> 18:42.359
That was in front of a public audience.

18:42.359 --> 18:43.759
I have to give Mr. Jiang

18:43.759 --> 18:45.160
some face.

18:46.400 --> 18:47.440
But in private,

18:48.319 --> 18:50.480
what I did was infuriating.

18:50.480 --> 18:52.799
I deliberately used hellish
tricks to torture them.

18:53.839 --> 18:56.119
I will not say specifically what I did.

18:56.119 --> 18:57.799
I'm afraid of dirtying your ears.

18:57.799 --> 19:00.480
In short, I vented your spleen for you.

19:01.440 --> 19:03.200
There is enough money at home.

19:03.200 --> 19:04.960
It's easy to bribe the ten judges of hell.

19:05.559 --> 19:07.519
If you go to hell for me,

19:07.519 --> 19:08.920
I'll certainly rescue you myself.

19:11.279 --> 19:12.680
Thank you, Mr. Jiang,

19:12.680 --> 19:14.319
for being so generous.

19:18.079 --> 19:19.680
I should be the one thanking you.

19:24.400 --> 19:25.960
Thank you for your ruthless methods,

19:25.960 --> 19:27.240
for relieving my deep-seated grudge,

19:32.200 --> 19:34.240
for committing crimes for me,

19:34.240 --> 19:36.680
and for sinking to the same level as me.

19:42.920 --> 19:44.799
Thank you for your clear insight,

19:44.799 --> 19:46.480
knowing full well…

19:46.480 --> 19:47.640
Say no more.

19:47.640 --> 19:49.119
Everything is said in the wine.

19:50.200 --> 19:51.784
I hear you.

19:53.400 --> 19:55.240
Your hand injury hasn't healed yet.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.240
You mustn't drink alcohol.

19:57.279 --> 19:58.440
This cup of wine

19:58.440 --> 19:59.912
ought to be drunk by me.

20:00.759 --> 20:01.992
Here's to

20:03.079 --> 20:04.232
hearing me.

20:19.559 --> 20:20.680
I drank too fiercely.

20:21.720 --> 20:22.880
It was just drunken babble.

20:23.880 --> 20:25.288
Don't take it seriously.

20:33.960 --> 20:35.319
I know.

20:35.319 --> 20:36.359
Drunken babble.

20:39.279 --> 20:41.039
Mr. Jiang, but what you just said

20:41.039 --> 20:42.200
wasn't babble, right?

20:42.200 --> 20:44.000
You said you had enough money at home.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.680
This is my first time being a villain,

20:46.680 --> 20:48.119
fighting and killing,

20:48.119 --> 20:49.880
buying medicine and buying knives.

20:49.880 --> 20:51.440
It cost me quite a bit of money.

20:51.440 --> 20:52.680
I wonder…

20:52.680 --> 20:53.880
I'm in a good mood today.

20:54.440 --> 20:55.688
Let's hear it.

20:56.440 --> 20:58.920
Considering my diligence and effort

20:58.920 --> 21:01.200
and that Huamanzhu is expanding,

21:01.200 --> 21:02.599
why not amend the contract

21:02.599 --> 21:03.759
to a 40-60 split?

21:03.759 --> 21:05.880
You're addicted to playing the part
of a crooked merchant, aren't you?

21:05.880 --> 21:07.079
Getting an inch and trying to take a mile?

21:07.079 --> 21:08.359
That's not the case.

21:09.000 --> 21:10.160
After all, what I did for you

21:10.160 --> 21:12.039
was bully the kind and oppress the weak.

21:12.039 --> 21:13.759
If you did it yourself,

21:13.759 --> 21:15.319
you would surely go to hellfire,

21:15.839 --> 21:17.559
being roasted by fire every day yet not dying.

21:18.079 --> 21:19.200
How terrifying would that be?

21:20.559 --> 21:21.599
Mr. Jiang.

21:21.599 --> 21:24.240
This charcoal doesn't seem
to burn anymore, does it?

21:25.279 --> 21:26.559
Mr. Jiang, please have a look.

21:26.559 --> 21:27.759
Isn't this charcoal burning anymore?

21:27.759 --> 21:29.559
This is my only weakness.

21:29.559 --> 21:31.119
And it's fallen into your hands, you villain.

21:32.920 --> 21:35.160
Oh well, as you wish.

21:36.039 --> 21:37.240
Thank you very much, Mr. Jiang.

21:37.960 --> 21:39.240
If that's the case,

21:39.240 --> 21:40.319
I must toast to you.

21:41.799 --> 21:43.240
I've told you not to drink.

21:43.240 --> 21:45.039
Why won't you listen to the doctor?

21:45.039 --> 21:47.599
Relax, I haven't drunk in a long time.

21:47.599 --> 21:49.519
My throat got itchy seeing you drink.

21:49.519 --> 21:51.200
I'll just have one drink.
Come on, give it to me

21:51.200 --> 21:52.359
Not even one cup.

21:52.359 --> 21:53.559
Jiang Changyang.

21:53.559 --> 21:54.839
- Let me have a drink.
- No way.

21:54.839 --> 21:55.880
Just let me have one cup.

21:55.880 --> 21:57.640
- No.
- You…

21:57.640 --> 21:59.079
What? Give it to me.

21:59.079 --> 22:01.680
- No, no.
- My hand is injured.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.720
So you can't drink.

22:02.720 --> 22:04.359
- Look at this charcoal fire.
- No, no way.

22:04.359 --> 22:05.640
Jiang Changyang, are you…

22:05.640 --> 22:07.160
- Put it down, put it down.
- Look at this.

22:07.160 --> 22:08.440
Careful, careful.

22:08.440 --> 22:09.960
Look, how come this isn't burning?

22:16.000 --> 22:17.240
I wanted to invite Master Doctor Fu

22:17.240 --> 22:19.079
to accompany me to see other patients,

22:19.079 --> 22:20.720
but he was too busy.

22:20.720 --> 22:22.440
He has returned to the palace.

22:22.440 --> 22:23.759
It's really strange.

22:23.759 --> 22:25.480
There are only so many people in the palace.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.880
And how many people are outside the palace?

22:27.680 --> 22:30.440
Those nobles are usually served
with luxurious food and clothing.

22:30.440 --> 22:31.680
Could they also be physically weak

22:31.680 --> 22:32.880
or prone to illnesses?

22:34.279 --> 22:36.160
After all, he holds a position
in the Imperial Medical Bureau,

22:36.160 --> 22:37.519
and he only takes care of things inside.

22:37.519 --> 22:39.519
So it was quite difficult for him
to come out and help.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.279
But a doctor has a compassionate heart.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.000
Whether it's for princes, nobles,

22:44.000 --> 22:45.720
or for the common folk,

22:45.720 --> 22:47.039
in the eyes of a physician,

22:47.039 --> 22:48.160
shouldn't they all be the same?

22:48.960 --> 22:50.839
That's why we need

22:50.839 --> 22:51.880
doctors like Chun.

22:54.079 --> 22:56.000
Actually, Master Doctor Fu
is one of the good ones.

22:56.559 --> 22:58.880
He has never looked down
upon women practicing medicine.

22:58.880 --> 23:00.440
And he even praised you

23:00.440 --> 23:02.240
for handling the child properly.

23:03.559 --> 23:06.200
In the future, you can jot down any
difficult diseases you encounter.

23:06.799 --> 23:09.839
He takes Jiang Changyang's pulse
every month for well-being,

23:09.839 --> 23:11.400
and you can consult him then.

23:12.519 --> 23:13.640
That's wonderful.

23:13.640 --> 23:15.720
This way, he manages the inside,
and I'll manage the outside.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.039
No patients will be neglected.

23:20.359 --> 23:22.000
Why did you want to become a physician?

23:24.400 --> 23:26.759
My grandfather came from a family
with a long history in medicine,

23:26.759 --> 23:28.480
saving countless lives throughout his life.

23:28.480 --> 23:30.039
On the day of his peaceful passing,

23:30.039 --> 23:31.079
the people who came to mourn

23:31.079 --> 23:32.440
formed a line two miles long.

23:33.519 --> 23:35.039
You practice medicine

23:35.559 --> 23:37.079
because of your grandfather.

23:38.680 --> 23:39.720
At first,

23:39.720 --> 23:41.720
I merely admired the kind
of person my grandfather was,

23:41.720 --> 23:42.720
but later, I accidentally opened

23:42.720 --> 23:44.400
the medical books he left behind,

23:44.400 --> 23:46.240
and somehow, I became engrossed in them.

23:47.200 --> 23:49.480
Now, healing and saving lives have become

23:49.480 --> 23:50.599
the most important thing for me.

23:51.160 --> 23:53.119
I feel anxious if I don't
see patients for a day.

23:55.400 --> 23:56.559
In that case,

23:56.559 --> 23:58.720
how about I give you flowers that are
not used by Huamanzhu in the future

23:58.720 --> 24:00.440
to research for medicinal use?

24:01.200 --> 24:03.359
Really? Mudan, thank you.

24:05.000 --> 24:07.119
Your hand will still need
medication for a few more days.

24:07.640 --> 24:09.759
You can try bending your fingers
in the next few days.

24:09.759 --> 24:11.200
But if you feel any pain,

24:11.200 --> 24:12.680
you must stop immediately.

24:12.680 --> 24:14.056
Okay.

24:14.960 --> 24:17.039
Then, may I take up the brush?

24:17.640 --> 24:19.720
Recently, the shop has introduced new flowers.

24:19.720 --> 24:21.559
I want to paint some Herbaceous
Peony paintings in advance

24:21.559 --> 24:22.640
to be hung in front of the store.

24:22.640 --> 24:24.039
Absolutely not.

24:24.039 --> 24:25.519
Painting takes too long.

24:25.519 --> 24:27.359
When muscles and tendons are
strained for long, they do not recover well.

24:27.880 --> 24:29.359
How about this, I will help you.

24:30.279 --> 24:32.400
I often copy various types
of herbs in normal times.

24:32.400 --> 24:34.359
Let me take a look
at the new flower you mentioned.

24:34.359 --> 24:35.359
I am sure I can paint it.

24:36.920 --> 24:38.200
That's wonderful.

24:38.200 --> 24:39.319
Thank you for your effort, Chun.

24:47.279 --> 24:48.680
It's okay, you can touch it.

24:48.680 --> 24:49.839
Just touch it gently.

25:11.160 --> 25:12.840
Mudan.

25:15.759 --> 25:17.224
What's the matter?

25:18.559 --> 25:20.039
Previously, she only looked at your hand.

25:20.039 --> 25:21.480
Why is she looking at your flowers today?

25:22.319 --> 25:24.119
These Herbaceous Peonies
have not been put on sale yet.

25:24.119 --> 25:25.680
What if she reveals it to Lv Wanrong

25:25.680 --> 25:27.759
and the flower guild gets ahead of us?

25:27.759 --> 25:29.480
She came to paint for me.

25:30.160 --> 25:31.200
And premium varieties

25:31.200 --> 25:32.279
like Fire Gold Peony

25:32.279 --> 25:33.359
can't be cultivated

25:33.359 --> 25:34.839
in one or two days.

25:35.480 --> 25:36.519
You don't need to worry.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.680
You seem to treat her

25:39.680 --> 25:41.279
differently from others.

25:44.880 --> 25:47.200
Chun is indeed not like an ordinary woman.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.519
She has the benevolent heart of a healer.

25:50.759 --> 25:52.640
She is worth trust and respect.

26:13.680 --> 26:15.000
It was fine just a few days ago.

26:15.000 --> 26:16.319
How did it suddenly turn like this?

26:19.279 --> 26:20.839
What kind of bug is this?

26:22.480 --> 26:23.759
It's scale insects.

26:23.759 --> 26:26.000
We always have set up pest control measures.

26:26.680 --> 26:28.480
Even if there are ones
that slip through the net,

26:28.480 --> 26:30.519
it shouldn't harm all the flowers.

26:32.000 --> 26:34.480
I specifically checked when we last fertilized.

26:34.480 --> 26:36.160
I didn't see any bugs.

26:40.759 --> 26:42.759
Do you have any left from the last batch
of flower fertilizer we received?

26:53.279 --> 26:55.000
Someone has put insect eggs

26:55.000 --> 26:56.200
into our fertilizer,

26:56.200 --> 26:57.359
intending to harm our flowers.

26:58.519 --> 26:59.720
I…

27:00.519 --> 27:01.759
It was my negligence.

27:01.759 --> 27:03.880
I failed to notice during fertilization.

27:05.240 --> 27:07.160
Shengyi, you don't need to blame yourself.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.160
Look at these insect eggs.

27:09.119 --> 27:11.039
They used very tiny insect eggs.

27:11.039 --> 27:13.279
You can't distinguish them just by looking.

27:13.279 --> 27:15.359
Moreover, these eggs take two or three days

27:15.359 --> 27:16.640
to hatch into pests.

27:17.720 --> 27:19.000
- I've checked it out.
- How is it?

27:19.000 --> 27:20.799
The Mengdiexiang in Huamanzhu is fine.

27:23.279 --> 27:24.519
Fortunately, it seems that only

27:24.519 --> 27:26.039
the flower fertilizer in the family

27:26.039 --> 27:27.039
has been tampered with.

27:28.759 --> 27:30.152
Lv Gengchun?

27:30.839 --> 27:32.440
Yesterday, she used the excuse of painting

27:32.440 --> 27:34.200
and stayed alone
in the courtyard for a long while.

27:35.319 --> 27:37.720
I wondered why she was so kind-hearted.

27:37.720 --> 27:39.759
She must have tipped off Lv Wanrong.

27:40.400 --> 27:41.640
The flower guild fears that we will snatch away

27:41.640 --> 27:43.359
the market for the expensive Herbaceous Peonies

27:43.359 --> 27:45.000
and asked her to add pests

27:45.000 --> 27:46.119
when we were unprepared.

27:47.039 --> 27:48.279
Not only Chun knows

27:48.279 --> 27:49.640
that we are cultivating premium varieties.

27:49.640 --> 27:50.799
People who understand flowers

27:50.799 --> 27:52.720
can deduce what kind of flowers

27:52.720 --> 27:53.839
the fertilizer

27:53.839 --> 27:56.279
is intended for from the formula.

27:56.279 --> 27:57.319
Moreover,

27:57.319 --> 27:58.839
these eggs are very likely

27:59.440 --> 28:01.160
to have been added

28:01.160 --> 28:02.960
before entering our house.

28:02.960 --> 28:04.839
But the one who provides
the fertilizer is one of our own.

28:04.839 --> 28:06.039
There's no reason for them to do this.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.200
Yes.

28:08.200 --> 28:09.480
The only one who had the opportunity to access

28:09.480 --> 28:10.640
the flower fertilizer as an outsider

28:11.160 --> 28:12.599
was only Lv Gengchun.

28:17.799 --> 28:18.960
I really didn't do it.

28:20.440 --> 28:22.440
Go back and tell your father

28:22.440 --> 28:23.960
that you've got what you wished.

28:23.960 --> 28:25.039
You're not welcome here.

28:25.039 --> 28:27.640
Leave or I'll serve you with my fists.

28:27.640 --> 28:29.240
Fu, don't be rough.

28:35.799 --> 28:37.400
Mudan.

28:37.400 --> 28:38.519
I really didn't do it.

28:39.119 --> 28:41.720
Don't you believe me?

28:43.720 --> 28:45.512
I believe you.

28:46.359 --> 28:47.400
If it really was her doing,

28:47.400 --> 28:48.599
why would she incriminate herself?

28:48.599 --> 28:49.759
She must be innocent.

28:51.880 --> 28:53.759
Even if she didn't do it,

28:53.759 --> 28:55.240
it must have been ordered by Lv Wanrong.

28:55.240 --> 28:57.519
- Right.
- You know it.

28:57.519 --> 28:59.519
The flower guild has always
been trying to trip us up.

29:00.480 --> 29:01.559
It must be her.

29:01.559 --> 29:02.920
But my father is not that kind of person.

29:02.920 --> 29:04.559
Say that again, go on, tell me.

29:04.559 --> 29:05.559
Fu.

29:07.079 --> 29:08.680
Right now, the most important
thing is to save the flowers.

29:08.680 --> 29:11.240
After that, we can discuss the truth.

29:11.240 --> 29:12.279
I'll go get water.

29:12.279 --> 29:13.640
Quick, find some sulfur and crush it.

29:13.640 --> 29:15.279
Put it in the water to lure and kill the pests.

29:15.279 --> 29:16.559
Hurry.

29:16.559 --> 29:18.248
Go ahead.

29:21.240 --> 29:22.759
Mudan.

29:22.759 --> 29:23.880
Let me help you.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.559
Right now, we're short-handed.

29:29.720 --> 29:30.960
Help us then.

29:32.440 --> 29:33.544
Come on.

29:52.104 --> 29:57.384
♫ The Luo River cleanses the moonlight haze ♫

29:57.384 --> 30:02.764
♫ Flowing into a scorching long river ♫

30:03.787 --> 30:09.099
♫ A jade-like face not yet indulged
in mundane pleasures ♫

30:11.480 --> 30:12.480
Come on, Fu.

30:15.272 --> 30:16.680
Mudan.

30:18.261 --> 30:21.387
♫ Let not the secular world constrain ♫

30:21.387 --> 30:24.555
♫ How can they guess with mundane eyes ♫

30:24.555 --> 30:31.051
♫ Smiling as the storm stir the dust ♫

30:31.051 --> 30:35.002
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

30:35.002 --> 30:36.715
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

30:36.715 --> 30:38.603
♫ Never withering ♫

30:38.603 --> 30:45.331
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

30:55.319 --> 30:56.759
Chun, your paintings are indeed good.

30:59.720 --> 31:01.160
Come on.

31:05.400 --> 31:06.839
I need to change your bandage for a new one

31:06.839 --> 31:07.880
to avoid infection.

31:07.880 --> 31:09.416
Okay.

31:10.759 --> 31:12.559
Mudan.

31:12.559 --> 31:14.160
Thank you for trusting me.

31:16.240 --> 31:18.319
Don't blame Fu and Shengyi.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.039
The flower guild has come to make trouble

31:20.039 --> 31:21.240
time and again.

31:21.240 --> 31:22.880
They were just momentarily agitated.

31:23.599 --> 31:25.759
I know competitors
in the industry resort to tricks.

31:26.440 --> 31:29.039
But my father is also a person
who truly loves flowers.

31:29.039 --> 31:30.079
If he could allow me

31:30.079 --> 31:31.759
to freely pick the peonies at home,

31:31.759 --> 31:34.160
I wouldn't have to sneakily
buy flowers from Huamanzhu.

31:39.319 --> 31:42.079
One year, Chang'an suffered a pest disaster.

31:42.079 --> 31:43.799
The entire city's peonies withered.

31:43.799 --> 31:45.920
Only my father came up with a remedy.

31:46.559 --> 31:48.839
At that time, he was just
a humble flower seller,

31:48.839 --> 31:50.839
yet he didn't profit hugely from this.

31:50.839 --> 31:53.079
Instead, he taught the method to others

31:53.079 --> 31:54.279
and saved the city's peonies.

31:55.079 --> 31:56.480
Father often told me

31:56.480 --> 31:57.559
that if not this year,

31:57.559 --> 31:59.119
money can be made in the next year.

31:59.119 --> 32:01.319
But if the city's peonies do not bloom,

32:01.319 --> 32:03.160
there will be no spring this year.

32:05.759 --> 32:07.160
No wonder your father

32:07.160 --> 32:09.039
can take the position of guild head

32:09.039 --> 32:10.599
and stay there for a decade.

32:11.839 --> 32:14.079
Father indeed opposes women doing business,

32:14.079 --> 32:15.640
and sometimes, he acts too stubbornly.

32:17.119 --> 32:18.960
But he is certainly not a man of ill intent.

32:19.480 --> 32:21.640
The act of placing insect eggs
to damage flowers

32:21.640 --> 32:23.000
will never be his doing.

32:24.640 --> 32:25.920
Of course, I trust

32:25.920 --> 32:27.119
your father's character.

32:29.799 --> 32:31.160
But Chun,

32:31.160 --> 32:33.200
your father is now the guild head,

32:33.200 --> 32:36.000
and Huamanzhu has indeed taken
a lot of business from the flower guild.

32:37.440 --> 32:38.480
Even if your father

32:39.519 --> 32:41.119
is unwilling to do certain things,

32:41.759 --> 32:42.799
others

32:43.400 --> 32:44.559
might do it for him.

32:47.599 --> 32:48.680
If the person behind the scenes

32:48.680 --> 32:50.039
is truly from the flower guild,

32:50.039 --> 32:52.720
you can certainly capture him
and confront my father.

32:52.720 --> 32:54.119
He will surely punish him
severely without neglect.

33:14.480 --> 33:15.960
That's truly foolish.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.880
To repeatedly use the same trick
without even changing the pattern.

33:18.960 --> 33:20.319
Whose top dressing is this?

33:20.319 --> 33:21.920
It's from Mr. Cai, just delivered.

33:21.920 --> 33:23.528
The person is still at the door.

33:26.759 --> 33:28.559
Shopkeeper.

33:28.559 --> 33:29.880
Can I help you?

33:31.599 --> 33:33.839
Why did you put insects in my fertilizers?

33:34.960 --> 33:36.456
Insects?

33:37.519 --> 33:39.119
What… What insects?

33:39.119 --> 33:40.759
I don't know.

33:40.759 --> 33:42.200
Fine, you won't say it.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.279
Fu, tie him up

33:43.279 --> 33:44.424
and take him to the authorities.

33:45.864 --> 33:48.640
Wait, you have no proof.

33:48.640 --> 33:49.799
Even if you take me to the officials,

33:49.799 --> 33:51.079
it will be of no use.

33:51.079 --> 33:52.400
I don't know anything.

33:52.960 --> 33:54.319
At worst,

33:54.319 --> 33:55.400
I will just be judged as being negligent.

33:55.400 --> 33:57.480
I can withstand a few lashes.

33:59.480 --> 34:01.119
Who says there's no evidence?

34:01.839 --> 34:03.599
In the past, when you came
to deliver fertilizer,

34:03.599 --> 34:05.640
you wore clothes that had been
washed many times.

34:06.480 --> 34:08.599
Now, not to mention the new clothes,

34:09.239 --> 34:11.440
you're also wearing silk damask soft shoes.

34:11.440 --> 34:12.719
With your wages,

34:12.719 --> 34:14.559
you can't afford such attire.

34:16.079 --> 34:17.920
It doesn't matter if you don't admit it.

34:17.920 --> 34:19.079
Let's report it to the official.

34:19.840 --> 34:21.639
After all, the person who hired
you to harm Huamanzhu

34:21.639 --> 34:23.280
must have given you a considerable reward.

34:23.280 --> 34:26.119
You can't spend all this money at once.

34:26.119 --> 34:28.280
When the officers search your home,
they will surely find out.

34:29.159 --> 34:31.519
Not only will you not be able to keep
a single penny of this money,

34:31.519 --> 34:33.079
but you'll end up owing me a lot.

34:34.360 --> 34:35.800
And as for you,

34:35.800 --> 34:36.840
you won't be let off

34:36.840 --> 34:37.960
with just a few lashes.

34:40.119 --> 34:41.440
Let's report to the authorities.

34:41.440 --> 34:43.119
Don't, don't.

34:43.119 --> 34:44.519
Mercy, Shopkeeper, show mercy.

34:44.519 --> 34:46.159
I'm… I'm sorry.

34:46.159 --> 34:47.639
I'm so sorry.

34:47.639 --> 34:49.400
Shopkeeper, have mercy,
I'll tell you everything.

34:49.400 --> 34:51.480
Shopkeeper, this is my first time, I…

34:52.400 --> 34:54.280
Father.

34:56.840 --> 34:59.400
Usually, you only greet, have your meals,

34:59.400 --> 35:02.039
and stay in your boudoir embroidering.

35:02.039 --> 35:04.440
What made you want to go out
all of a sudden today?

35:05.079 --> 35:06.239
I've been cooped up at home for too long,

35:06.239 --> 35:07.440
so I wanted to come out and get some fresh air.

35:08.800 --> 35:10.344
Alright.

35:17.039 --> 35:18.480
Greetings.

35:18.480 --> 35:20.159
Bring me another pot of wine.

35:22.760 --> 35:24.119
Guild Head Lv.

35:24.119 --> 35:25.119
What a coincidence.

35:26.760 --> 35:29.559
It seems that Huamanzhu is doing quite well.

35:29.559 --> 35:31.039
Shopkeeper,

35:31.039 --> 35:32.880
you've started drinking
and enjoying yourself so early.

35:34.400 --> 35:36.199
Guild Head Lv, that's not it.

35:36.199 --> 35:38.199
I'm drinking to drown my sorrows.

35:38.199 --> 35:39.519
A few days ago, my yard

35:39.519 --> 35:40.639
suffered from a pest infestation.

35:40.639 --> 35:42.559
It destroyed many of my prized peonies.

35:42.559 --> 35:44.039
The weather has been damp
and hot these few days.

35:44.039 --> 35:45.880
You must be very careful as well, guild head.

35:54.519 --> 35:56.880
You used to let
the subordinates relay messages.

35:56.880 --> 35:58.400
What exactly has happened

35:58.400 --> 35:59.719
that made you insist on seeing me today?

36:00.280 --> 36:03.320
You had me infest
Huamanzhu's peonies with pests,

36:03.320 --> 36:04.480
but you didn't tell me

36:04.480 --> 36:07.199
that those peonies were all
expensive premium varieties.

36:08.079 --> 36:09.639
The little benefit you gave me before

36:10.280 --> 36:11.320
was too little.

36:14.679 --> 36:16.599
You scoundrel!

36:17.320 --> 36:18.679
You haven't even accomplished the task yet,

36:18.679 --> 36:20.159
and you're already telling me this?

36:21.719 --> 36:23.639
Fortunately, it wasn't accomplished.

36:23.639 --> 36:24.800
If it had been,

36:24.800 --> 36:26.639
Vice guild head, would you acknowledge it?

36:27.480 --> 36:29.679
It's not difficult to make all

36:29.679 --> 36:30.679
her peonies wither.

36:30.679 --> 36:32.320
Just give me more money.

36:34.880 --> 36:35.920
How much?

36:35.920 --> 36:37.032
Well…

36:41.280 --> 36:42.519
Guild head.

36:42.519 --> 36:43.719
What are you doing here?

36:43.719 --> 36:46.119
I can ask you the same question.

36:48.424 --> 36:49.672
Bribing the flower grower

36:49.672 --> 36:50.728
and harming the plants,

36:50.728 --> 36:52.079
the evidence is conclusive.

36:52.880 --> 36:54.519
Plus the last time you bribed the geomancer

36:54.519 --> 36:56.400
and spread rumors about me everywhere.

36:56.400 --> 36:57.960
I can no longer tolerate it.

37:00.639 --> 37:02.519
Guild head.

37:02.519 --> 37:04.000
I do not wish to be
an enemy of the flower guild.

37:04.559 --> 37:06.960
That's why I haven't submitted the personal
and material evidence to the authorities.

37:07.559 --> 37:08.679
Yet I still hope guild head

37:08.679 --> 37:09.960
can give me an explanation.

37:11.480 --> 37:13.039
I often admonish you

37:13.880 --> 37:15.159
that restraining others is fine,

37:15.679 --> 37:17.280
but don't suppress too much.

37:18.079 --> 37:20.119
But you didn't listen,

37:20.119 --> 37:21.920
and even tried to ruin someone's innocence.

37:23.039 --> 37:25.440
Damaging flowers is
a big taboo in the industry.

37:25.440 --> 37:26.719
As the deputy guild head,

37:26.719 --> 37:28.119
you knowingly committed the offense.

37:28.119 --> 37:29.360
I must follow the industry rules

37:29.360 --> 37:31.079
and expel you from the flower guild.

37:31.079 --> 37:32.280
You must not engage

37:32.280 --> 37:33.719
in any trade related to flowers again.

37:36.519 --> 37:38.280
Mr. Lv,

37:38.280 --> 37:39.440
you and I have known each other for many years.

37:40.079 --> 37:41.159
You know that over the years,

37:41.719 --> 37:43.519
I have exhausted myself for the flower guild.

37:44.159 --> 37:46.079
If I am not allowed to touch flowers again,

37:47.039 --> 37:48.920
how will I live the rest of my life?

37:49.960 --> 37:51.519
Mr. Lv.

37:51.519 --> 37:53.320
I truly had a momentary lapse of judgment.

37:53.840 --> 37:55.000
I assure you

37:55.000 --> 37:56.079
that I will never do

37:56.079 --> 37:57.440
such things again.

37:57.440 --> 38:00.296
Mr. Lv.

38:02.480 --> 38:04.320
I'm not the principal victim in this matter.

38:04.840 --> 38:06.360
The one you need forgiveness from

38:06.920 --> 38:08.559
is the shopkeeper of Huamanzhu.

38:13.719 --> 38:15.400
Shopkeeper.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.639
I've made a big mistake.

38:19.079 --> 38:20.800
I am willing to compensate
you for all your losses.

38:21.760 --> 38:23.760
All I ask for

38:23.760 --> 38:25.079
is for you to turn a blind eye

38:25.960 --> 38:27.079
and let me off.

38:32.320 --> 38:33.840
The guild head is a compassionate person.

38:35.039 --> 38:37.280
I seek justice,

38:37.280 --> 38:38.880
but I don't want
to cut off someone's livelihood.

38:40.960 --> 38:43.079
Those who truly deserve to be looked down upon

38:43.079 --> 38:44.840
are never us women in commerce,

38:45.840 --> 38:47.039
but people like you

38:47.559 --> 38:49.079
who abuse their authority

38:49.079 --> 38:50.519
and oppress women.

38:52.400 --> 38:53.679
I am willing to let bygones be bygones,

38:54.880 --> 38:55.880
but Cao Yuying,

38:56.440 --> 38:58.639
you must compensate me
five times the market price.

38:59.280 --> 39:01.039
I also hope that in the future,

39:01.039 --> 39:02.679
the flower guild can coexist peacefully with us

39:03.559 --> 39:04.840
without hindering us anymore.

39:06.920 --> 39:08.000
You are magnanimous.

39:08.960 --> 39:10.239
I thank you on behalf of Yuying.

39:11.960 --> 39:13.704
Yuying.

39:14.559 --> 39:15.599
Although

39:15.599 --> 39:16.679
for the sake of the flower guild's reputation,

39:16.679 --> 39:18.119
this matter shouldn't be publicized,

39:19.119 --> 39:20.239
you can no longer hold

39:20.239 --> 39:21.400
the position of deputy guild head.

39:22.079 --> 39:24.719
From now on, I hope you will
take good care of the flowers

39:24.719 --> 39:26.639
and no longer harbor ill intentions.

39:28.360 --> 39:29.480
I understand.

39:32.000 --> 39:33.608
Thank you, guild head.

39:35.079 --> 39:36.559
Thank you, Shopkeeper.

39:46.119 --> 39:48.119
Previously, seeing that you were a woman,

39:48.119 --> 39:49.280
I underestimated you.

39:50.199 --> 39:52.800
I didn't expect you to successfully cultivate
the delicate and difficult-to-grow

39:52.800 --> 39:53.840
Fire Gold Peony.

39:54.920 --> 39:56.639
If you are willing,

39:56.639 --> 39:58.800
I can make an exception
and let you join the guild.

40:01.000 --> 40:02.320
Thank you for your kind intentions.

40:02.320 --> 40:05.039
But the guild has too many

40:05.039 --> 40:06.280
rules for women.

40:06.280 --> 40:07.519
It's not very suitable for me.

40:07.519 --> 40:09.480
So I'll have to decline.

40:09.480 --> 40:11.280
Rules are not something

40:11.280 --> 40:12.280
that can be changed overnight.

40:12.280 --> 40:14.320
They require considerable deliberation.

40:14.320 --> 40:15.440
If you join the guild,

40:16.039 --> 40:17.920
should you encounter pests or other problems

40:17.920 --> 40:19.079
again in the future,

40:19.079 --> 40:21.079
there will also be fellow
members to assist you.

40:21.079 --> 40:22.519
A woman in commerce

40:22.519 --> 40:23.840
faces a difficult path.

40:23.840 --> 40:25.000
Struggling alone

40:25.000 --> 40:26.679
will make it even harder.

40:27.599 --> 40:29.079
There are thousands of paths in the world.

40:29.079 --> 40:30.639
Which path is easy to travel?

40:31.199 --> 40:33.000
I'll see it as exploring the road

40:33.000 --> 40:34.079
on behalf of other women.

40:36.519 --> 40:40.000
It seems we can only become rivals now.

40:41.519 --> 40:43.159
Having rivals keeps us constantly vigilant

40:43.159 --> 40:44.800
without slackening.

40:44.800 --> 40:46.280
Compared to uniformity,

40:46.280 --> 40:48.239
Guild head, I think you share my intention

40:48.920 --> 40:51.000
to see all the flowers bloom in Chang'an,

40:51.679 --> 40:52.920
competing in splendor and beauty.

40:55.519 --> 40:56.776
[Spring Blossoms and Autumn Moon]
See you.

41:26.801 --> 41:33.075
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

41:34.929 --> 41:41.613
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

41:42.289 --> 41:49.487
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

41:50.481 --> 41:58.833
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

41:58.833 --> 42:06.376
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:07.030 --> 42:15.217
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:15.217 --> 42:23.028
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:23.633 --> 42:30.925
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

42:51.601 --> 42:58.484
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

42:59.785 --> 43:06.479
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:07.236 --> 43:14.538
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:15.222 --> 43:23.531
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:23.531 --> 43:30.962
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

43:31.793 --> 43:40.049
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

43:40.049 --> 43:47.473
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:48.477 --> 43:55.927
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
